<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 8.0 bln Skr T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 8.0 bln Skr T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of Treasury bills.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on February 5, it said and bids are due by 1130 GMT on the day of the auction. Settlement date is February 7.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE		ISSUE VOLUME	    NUMBER OF DAYS</p>
<p> May 21, 1997		 5.0 billion	     104</p>
